1) Rozbity endpoint POST /api/v1/filters/{id}/apply
   Oblast: API, filtry
   Lokace: backend/app/routers/api/v1/filters.py:91-103,
           backend/app/services/filter_service.py:836-876

   Problem:
   apply_filter_retroactively() vraci trojici
   (matched_count, changed_count, scoring_queued), ale API route unpackuje jen
   dve hodnoty:

       matched, changed = await apply_filter_retroactively(...)

   V realnem provozu endpoint spadne na ValueError: too many values to unpack.
   Webova cesta uz trojici unpackuje spravne.

   Dopad:
   API retroaktivni aplikace filtru je nepouzitelna a aktualni testy to mohou
   maskovat mockem vracejicim starou dvojici.

   Navrh reseni:
   - Unpackovat vsechny tri hodnoty.
   - Vratit scoring_queued v JSON response.
   - Opravit type hint a docstring apply_filter_retroactively() na
     tuple[int, int, int].
   - Zformatovat response schema explicitne, pokud nechceme response_model=dict.

   Test:
   - API test, ktery vola realnou service cestu nebo mockuje 3-tuple.
   - Asertovat 200 a response: matched, changed, scoring_queued.


