7) "Yesterday" catch-up a briefing zahrnuje i dnesni clanky
   Oblast: AI/catch-up/briefing
   Lokace: backend/app/services/catchup_service.py:40-55, 123-159

   Problem:
   Perioda yesterday pocita start na vcerejsi 00:00, ale query nema horni
   hranici. Podminka je jen:

       coalesce(published_at, fetched_at) >= start_dt

   Dopad:
   Digest oznaceny jako "Yesterday" obsahuje i dnesni clanky, spatne pocty a
   zavadejici briefing.

   Navrh reseni:
   - Period helper ma vracet interval (start_dt, end_dt).
   - yesterday: [vcera 00:00, dnes 00:00)
   - today: [dnes 00:00, now)
   - 7days: podle zameru rolling interval nebo [start, now).

   Test:
   - Fixni cas, user timezone, clanky vcera/dnes.
   - fetch_catchup_articles(period="yesterday") vraci pouze vcerejsi.
   - Stejnou cestu overit pres briefing service.


